    <string name="Download_UnknownSource_Notice">如果系統提示「安裝來源不明的應用程式」，您必須允許安裝。</string>
    <string name="DownloaderInstallFailed_PopUp_Des1">You can click \"Retry\" to reinstall the child\'s app.</string>
    <string name="DownloaderInstallFailed_PopUp_Des2">You can click \"Retry\" to reinstall the child\'s app. If it still fails, please click \"Redownload\" to access the download page and download the child\'s app again.\nIf the issue is still not resolved, please contact us.</string>
    <string name="DownloaderInstallFailed_PopUp_Des3">You can click \"Retry\" to reinstall the child\'s app. If it still fails, please click \"Manually Install\" to install it.\nIf the issue is still not resolved, please contact us.</string>
    <string name="KidsInstaller_Faq1_Des">方法1：安裝後，按鈕將切換為【開啟兒童端】，您可以點擊它開啟應用。\n方法2：透過裝置的瀏覽器訪問%s，然後在頁面上點擊【開啟兒童端】。</string>
    <string name="KidsInstaller_Faq1_Title">兒童應用的圖標將在安裝後被隱藏。如何打開它？</string>
    <string name="KidsInstaller_Faq2_Des">當您在兒童端中成功綁定此設備並授予必要的權限後，您可以按照應用中的步驟卸載 FlashGet Kids 安裝器。</string>
    <string name="KidsInstaller_Faq2_Title">兒童端安裝完成後，FlashGet Kids 安裝器會自動卸載嗎？</string>
    <string name="KidsInstaller_Faq3_Des">您可以關閉裝置的「WiFi」和「行動數據」，然後再嘗試安裝。\n如果關閉後仍然無法安裝，您可以「%s」查看其他安裝方法。</string>
    <string name="KidsInstaller_Faq3_Title">如果安裝過程中出現Google Protect彈窗並阻止安裝，我該怎麼辦？</string>
    <string name="KidsInstaller_InstallerNotUninstalled_Des">我們檢測到此設備上的 FlashGet Kids 安裝器尚未卸載。請卸載它，以防止您的孩子發現兒童端。</string>
